  "prompt": "Từ hai vị trí <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math> của một tòa nhà, người ta quan sát đỉnh <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>C</mi></semantics></math> của ngọn núi. Biết rằng độ cao <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>70</mn></mrow></semantics></math> m, phương nhìn <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> tạo với phương nằm ngang góc <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msup><mn>30</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></semantics></math>, phương nhìn <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> tạo với phương nằm ngang góc <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>15</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mn>30</mn><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Ngọn núi đó có độ cao so với mặt đất là bao nhiêu mét? (Kết quả làm tròn đến hàng đơn vi). \n\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/8fef9f67f0b5f8565645a0a7ae99a15b66512bba2d30111a7e1de95e54813762.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>",
  "choices": [],
  "correct": "135",
  "solution": "<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/bee9ef25209d6ac330de2c01ec0c7d57963bf6d137b0ef7b28c9367fc714cf45.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\tTa có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>90</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>30</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>90</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>15</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mn>30</mn><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>105</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mn>30</mn><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>180</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>105</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mn>30</mn><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>14</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mn>30</mn><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Áp dụng định lí sin cho <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><msup><mn>105</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mn>30</mn><mi>′</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><msup><mn>14</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mn>30</mn><mi>′</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><msup><mn>14</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mn>30</mn><mi>′</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mo>sin</mo><msup><mn>105</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mn>30</mn><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>70</mn><mrow><mo>sin</mo><msup><mn>14</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mn>30</mn><mi>′</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mo>sin</mo><msup><mn>105</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mn>30</mn><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Trong <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math> có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>sin</mo><msup><mn>30</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>70</mn><mrow><mo>sin</mo><msup><mn>14</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mn>30</mn><mi>′</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mo>sin</mo><msup><mn>105</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mn>30</mn><mi>′</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo>sin</mo><msup><mn>30</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>135</mn></mrow></semantics></math> m.<br>Vậy ngọn núi đó có độ cao so với mặt đất khoảng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>135</mn></semantics></math> m.",
